      "created_at": "2015-05-27T02:09:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I like the Horus ra and nightmist variant. just because how much infernal relics felt like the Ra/nightmist expansion since everything is centered around those two. Also rather see prime wardens come out all at once just for theme purposes. So I would say dark watch nightmist, Horus ra, and something else. &nbsp;The good part is the number of variants available start increasing as the game advances.&nbsp;</p>",
